{"server":"tw","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_06_beg","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_06","title":"反藝術運動","storyCode":"CR-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2605897b1cbd293ee5f8eb011d0b4108045924c69b9aaf14bbc8bdc8a2f0ca91","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"上尉派人假借消防檢查之名闖入社區。社區居民們在掩護下逃脫，但藝術節的準備工作遭到了毀滅性的打擊。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，老爹，外面來了很多士兵，架起了一道鐵絲網，氣勢洶洶地堵在樓底下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵？他們來幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們帶著授權文件來，說是要徹查這裡的消防隱患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……這是士兵該管的嗎？不應該是那些傻頭傻腦的政府機關人員來幹這事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，你帶著社區裡的老人和小孩離開這裡，到羅德島的辦公室找埃內斯托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人抄上傢伙和我走，今天我們也別想睡好覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我要留在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的源石技藝是我們中最好的，把他們交給你我才放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，記住我交代給你的任務，保護好那些人，無論發生什麼，都以這件事為重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好，老爹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諸位來到這裡到底是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亞茲·岡薩雷斯，我記得你，從辛嘉斯的軍隊退伍後，你來到多索雷斯成為市消防局的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在消防局待了五年，無數次在火場出入，換來的榮譽數都數不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼你現在卻淪落到了這個破爛的地方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是消防員，不論待在哪裡，做的都是防火救災的工作，豪華飯店的火是火，街頭巷尾的火也是火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是火，我都能救，我都會救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……迪亞茲你是內行人，一定會積極配合我們的工作，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少來這一套，你們打的主意我一清二楚，明面上說是消防檢查，實際上只是為了趕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也是為了這裡的安全著想，你也不想幾年前的火災重演吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾出去，這裡的事情我會操心，輪不到你們來指手畫腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不行啊，迪亞茲，這場藝術節表演已經吸引了全市的目光，這裡的事已經不光是你們的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來這裡，就是為了確保你們的表演不會對大家的生活造成不好的影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，滾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，老兄你還是不明白形勢啊，既然要檢查，我們怎麼能不做準備呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦諸位好好查一查了，每一個危險源頭都不要放過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人敢阻止我們的檢查，就是危害公共安全，直接動手吧，我們不用客氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這群混帳……這群該死的混帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾姐姐，我怕……我們到底要去哪裡啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有壞人進到社區裡來了，這裡不安全，我送你們去埃內斯托先生那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那其他人呢……我們就把他們丟在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老爹只說讓我看顧好你們……其他的……他會留下來安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們正在往這邊來，我們得趕緊離開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區電工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這是做什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"排查木偶的每條供電線路，只要有隱患，就統統給我拆個乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區電工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"我好不容易搭設好的電路啊，你們給我停手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開吧你，真礙眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區電工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"這位軍大人，別這樣，有話我們好好商量，我半年的心血啊……別拆了，求求你們別拆了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我管你搭了幾個月，就你這種故意破壞用電安全與擾亂供電秩序的行為，把你送去監獄都不過分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區電工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"停手啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區電工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區電工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"別……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*，哭哭啼啼煩死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區電工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……別……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惡劣的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼地方？這些傢伙的老巢？想不到這麼乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告，那兩尊木偶就在窗外，一開窗戶就能碰到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惡劣的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這兩尊大傢伙，裡面填充了多少保麗龍和木材，這要是著起火來可怎麼得了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惡劣的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拆，給我拆掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些混帳，不得好死！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是……一群到處撒野的東西……沒有教養……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"領隊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惡劣的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是怎麼做事的？！不是都叫你們把這些傢伙統統帶到外面的空地上去嗎？在那邊拖拖拉拉搞屁啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他帶著這群人一直掙扎個不停，我們很難控制住他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惡劣的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像剛才那樣狠狠朝他腦袋上來一下啊，你個蠢豬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惡劣的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，他現在多老實，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"畜生，你們這些畜生……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惡劣的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不趕快把他們弄走，這麼大兩個木偶，拆起來可得費一番功夫了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前方不遠處就是出口了，那些傢伙應該不會想到這裡來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人家，這裡地上滑，我扶著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，我們之後還會回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這裡是我們的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些人來了，又是砸又是拆……等我們回來，又得花好長的時間把家裡復原好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會為此付出代價的，我發誓……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等回來的時候，我會幫大家把壞掉的東西都復原好，我保證……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧，離辦事處還有好長一段路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，我也來扶著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家跟好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾？艾尼？快進來！你們怎麼過來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃內斯托在哪裡？我有事情找他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他之前說有私事，一個人出去了，到現在還沒有回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我和ELA小姐他們在這裡，他們剛幫忙整理好要帶去社區的物資，到底發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯合政府的人將社區圍起來了，藉著消防檢查的名義來破壞我們的藝術節表演……老爹叫我帶著他們來這裡先躲躲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾……那現在是什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA小姐，我……我也不知道，來的路上到處都是他們打砸東西的聲音……很多人都在哭，我不知道他們有沒有受傷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些混蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我現在得趕快回去，我不放心老爹，他嘴上逞強說是要我先走，他來對付那些人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但……他身體沒有以前好了……年紀大了，嘴巴還不饒人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得走了，ELA小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別哭，特克諾，我們和你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會幫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"DOC會留下來幫忙照顧那些老人和孩子，你可以放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA，特克諾帶來的人沒什麼大礙，這裡用不到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在更需要我幫忙的，應該是社區裡的人，我也一起去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這條通風管道未免也太長了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身上全是灰，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，DOC，你能下來嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的臀部有些寬……好像有些卡住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手給我，我拉你下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些通風管道你們爬很適合，我光進去就很艱難了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這裡被圍得水泄不通，原先逃跑的出路也有人看守，除了和我一起爬管子，再沒有能進來的辦法了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"FUZE，部署情況如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"情況比想像的複雜，在社區外有大量兵力守衛，我無法繼續跟進，但炸彈已經設定完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隨時可以啟動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窗外是什麼狀況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來的士兵人數遠超我想像……大家都被他們帶到外面了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人受傷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那有人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，放心，沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……那就好，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA，樓上有狙擊手，我們得先去解決他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"DOC，你和特克諾留在這裡，等我們的訊號再行動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在找什麼，特克諾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存儲器，大家的設計原稿都存在裡面了，他們毀了我們的木偶，但只要存儲器還在，遲早有天還能復現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫你找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懶的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，原本我想著上來偷懶抽根煙，沒想到撞上了幾隻偷偷摸摸的鼷獸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他交給我來收拾，你去拿存儲器，就在那邊的櫃子頂層。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懶的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，你還是讓你朋友來吧，就憑你個小身板，怕是連我的汗毛都碰不著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……你何必惹她呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你媽媽沒有教過你不要小看別人嗎？我非得狠狠揍你一頓不可！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懶的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我的腳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼小朋友？個子矮就是小朋友嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懶的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的鼻子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，小你X的朋友！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懶的軍官 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人我收拾掉了，存儲器找到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壞消息，櫃子頂層什麼都沒有，存儲器被人拿走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……到底是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別瞪著我了，迪亞茲先生，早說過讓你們配合點，現在這麼多人受傷，多不好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，事到如今你還擺著這副嘴臉給誰看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我把他按住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……你這傢伙，下手還真狠，要不是帶的人夠多，搞不好今天就得損在你的斧頭下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你一個壞消息，這次檢查我們發現了多處隱患，尤其是這對木偶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是開啟它們，會嚴重影響整個社區的供電，甚至周邊街區也有可能被波及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我特意讓大家都集中在了這裡，給所有人一個警示。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰……到底是誰讓你們來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惦記這裡的人不少……想把我們趕走的人也不少……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些人只會衝著我們來……我們在做什麼，他們根本不會在乎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們去之後，首要的目標是毀掉那兩個木娃娃，記住，一定要當著所有人的面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斷水、斷電、驅趕，那都是後面要做的事情，現在，我們得惹毛他們，激怒他們，然後……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們的怒火順著引線燒到該去的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會在那裡等你們的好消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了那個人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了那個傢伙……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你心中都有了答案，迪亞茲先生，何必再多問一句呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人都到齊了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動手吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著軍官一聲令下，等候在旁的士兵一擁而上，木偶的身體很快被拆解乾淨，製作材料與內部線路散落一地，只剩兩顆頭顱靠在一起。\n她們曾經靈動的眼珠從眼眶中脫落，露出裡面斷裂的線路。\n人群靜默無聲，很多人別開目光，不敢去看。\n只有迪亞茲，他從未偏過頭，眼也不眨地看著眼前的暴行，眼中充滿怒火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了，我在一個櫃子裡找到了這個……存儲器，我找人看過了，你們的設計原稿在裡面，還有些其他雜七雜八的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們今天毀掉的東西已經夠多了，連最後一點都不打算放過嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得杜絕一切隱患，迪亞茲先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"靜默的人群中傳出一聲細不可聞的啜泣，倔強如迪亞茲也忍不住垂下眼皮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混帳，把東西還給我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，竟然被搶走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幹什麼吃的？誰把這丫頭放過來的？把他給我抓住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老實點，把東西交出來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放開我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還想施術？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把東西給我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，想都不要想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還敢踹我？！*粗口*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"被特克諾一腳踹在臉上，軍官氣急敗壞地將她推倒在地，試圖強行搶奪，但杜林人始終沒有鬆開握緊存儲器的那隻手。\n幾次嘗試無果後，軍官放棄了，他面無表情地站起身，然後抬腳重重踩在特克諾緊握的手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一腳又一腳，直到腳下一片血肉模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放不放手？啊，放不放手？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……不放……有、有本事……你就、就來拿啊……"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在軍官再次抬起膝蓋時，一束紅光從樓上遙遙射出，照在他的額間，匯成一個小小的紅點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再踩一下試試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想感受三顆不同的子彈同時擊入你的身體，那就再踩一下試試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……你怎麼跑得那麼慢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我從四樓直接跳下來真的會摔死啊，特克諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著你的人離開這裡，先生，不然招呼你的就不僅僅是子彈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，該做的事情也都完成了……沒必要和你們在這裡耗著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知其他人，我們是時候撤離了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
